{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.MolienFakeDegreeInduction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.MolienFakeDegreeInduction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.MolienFakeDegreeGeneralN"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.MolienFakeDegreeInduction.molienSum_eq_qFactorial_of_recursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.MolienFakeDegreeInduction.molienSum_eq_qFactorial_of_recursion","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MolienFakeDegreeInduction.lean#L70-L80","doc":"**Main reduction (§3b-cond conditional).** For `1 < q`, the general-`n` fake-degree identity\n`molienSum n q = [n]_q!` holds for **all** `n`, **given** the base case and the one-step recursion\n(RECURSION). Combines the induction skeleton with the `GeneralN` equivalence\n`molienSum_eq_qFactorial_iff`. The residual is precisely (RECURSION) — reduced in the docstring to the\nsingle addable-box hook identity (B) plus branching (A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.MolienFakeDegreeInduction.normalizedSum_eq_one_of_recursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.MolienFakeDegreeInduction.normalizedSum_eq_one_of_recursion","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MolienFakeDegreeInduction.lean#L57-L68","doc":"**The whole `∀ n` fake-degree identity from ONE recursion.** Given the base case\n`normalizedSum 0 q = 1` and the one-step recursion `normalizedSum (m+1) q = normalizedSum m q` for\nevery `m`, `normalizedSum n q = 1` for all `n`, by induction on `n`. Pure, sorry-free — this is the\nwhole content of the induction, isolating the residual as the single hypothesis `step`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}